WEBVTT

00:12:29.825 --> 00:12:32.352
Picking your family
is about consciously choosing

00:12:32.376 --> 00:12:34.626
who and what you want

00:12:34.650 --> 00:12:38.202
rather than just making it work
or killing time

00:12:38.226 --> 00:12:40.739
with whoever happens to be choosing you.

00:12:41.963 --> 00:12:43.630
So what happened to Emma?

00:12:44.035 --> 00:12:46.225
Well, we went through that address book,

00:12:46.249 --> 00:12:48.142
and she found an old roommate's cousin

00:12:48.166 --> 00:12:50.903
who worked at an art museum
in another state.

00:12:51.671 --> 00:12:54.346
That weak tie helped her get a job there.

00:12:54.370 --> 00:12:58.288
That job offer gave her the reason
to leave that live-in boyfriend.

00:12:59.216 --> 00:13:02.998
Now, five years later, she's a special
events planner for museums.